---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — Tian de Klerk">
  <section class="about">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Tian de Klerk — a data engineer and engineering leader in the Netherlands, and a home
      lab and home automation tinkerer in my spare time.
    </p>
    <p>
      This is where I write down what I've been building and figuring out: AI agents, self-hosted
      infrastructure, and the automation that runs my house. Most writing about AI is <em>about</em>
      the technology; I'd rather write from inside the work, with the tools I actually use.
    </p>
    <p>
      The whole site is plain files in a git repository, so I often draft and edit it alongside the
      same AI models I write about. If something here is wrong or you just want to talk shop, get
      in touch.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about { padding-top: 56px; max-width: 58ch; }
  h1 {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 46px); letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin-bottom: 26px;
    text-transform: lowercase;
  }
  p { margin-bottom: 1.25em; font-size: 17.5px; }
</style>
